title: GiftStall
---
Old Garrick leans over his stall. "A birthday, is it? Well, your coin buys any one of these." #line:gift_001
-> A paper twist of honey sweets. #line:gift_opt_sweets
    <<set_label gift sweets>>
    "Sweets for the sweet," Garrick chuckles, and wraps them tight. #line:gift_ack_sweets
-> A ribbon the colour of cornflowers. #line:gift_opt_ribbon
    <<set_label gift ribbon>>
    "She'll wear that till it's rags," Garrick says, folding it neatly. #line:gift_ack_ribbon
-> A little wooden bird, carved by hand. #line:gift_opt_bird
    <<set_label gift carved_bird>>
    Garrick smiles. "Took me a week, that one. It'll last her a lifetime." #line:gift_ack_bird
===
